	(text "Power lite: 3S pack -> ShillehTek BMS (switches the negative lead; W1-W5) -> main switch (W6/W7) -> F1 15 A servo rail through K1, F2 3 A logic feed.\nK1 drops when the E-stop (J11, NC) opens or the ESP32 releases SERVO_EN. Design: docs/design-v6/2026-11-02-power-lite-options.md"
